Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上没有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's pretty much nothing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是Winchester兄弟解决不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们在一起的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到如何关上地狱之门的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out how to close the Gates of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.41,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂需要你的帮助 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven needs your help,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,被爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy 快停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:01:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点儿都说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,到底落下来了多少天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,how many angels fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,几百个 几千个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds?Thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是根本没人看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody sees anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,媒体报道说是流星雨 他们是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're calling it a meteor shower,seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么不对劲吗 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on man?Are you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,问我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.05,0:02:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还好 只是 - 只是现在咱们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine,just - It's just we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,多了这个奇葩的大难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}A major freaking crap that's on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢提醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you gotta tell me about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,上千个超能力混蛋们坠天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of superpower dicks touching down and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们却不知道从何下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no idea where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天使不是我们该关心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are not our problem right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 或者是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,or demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,或者Metatron 再或者Cass到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Metatron,or whatever the hell happened to Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 就因为咱俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?Because we.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在那栋教堂里来了个热情拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hugged it out in that church and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要去迪士尼玩儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're gonna go to Disneyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean you said yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,事情没解决前 不能休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna sleep until this is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么了 - 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what's the problem? - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 现在的情况就是这么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,there's no easy way to say this,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当时发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something happened back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在那栋教堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道是什么 我也不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what.I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,全球范围流星雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}GLOBAL METEOR SHOWER.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,核磁共振显示他体内有大面积烧伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The MRI shows the massive internal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,已经感染到重要器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burns affecting many of the major organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑严重供氧不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen to the brain has been severely deprived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,昏迷是因为身体的生理反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coma is the result of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,保证一切消耗最小化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing everything in its limited power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样能避免更多的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect itself from further harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不应该是这个样子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你弟弟继续维持这种状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your brother continues on this trajectory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这些机器是能让他活着 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines might keep him alive,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,终究还是会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,从技术角度讲 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕真是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 他不会恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,there's no recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 不会痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there's no bouncing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕现在要听天由命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's in God's hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你身为一个专业的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a medical professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟 该听天由命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That my brother's life is in God's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么 安慰我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,is that supposed to be a comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dougherty先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Dougherty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷跟此没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has nothing to do in this equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完全没有 - 我不是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At all - I didn't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别扯听天由命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,礼拜堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,are you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得我生你气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think that I'm pissed at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不在乎天使的坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,but I don't care the angels fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 不管你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,whatever you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,或者没做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or didn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,we'll work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,man,I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这条祷告面向所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes out to any angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}With their ears on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样 我们在林伍德纪念医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal is this,Linwood Memorial Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,伦道夫 纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randolph,New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个来帮助我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first one who could help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就能得到我的帮助作为回报 你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets my help in return,and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是块宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大家心里都清楚 我跟你们立场不一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell,it's no secret that we haven't always seen eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们也知道我是个信守承诺的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know that I'm good for my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一般我是不会轻易开口向你们求助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't be asking if I wasn't needing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说你快死了并不代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you're dying doesn't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经死了 你还活着好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.Not yet,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们已经度过了最艰难的时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've jimmied ourselves out of worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我们会挺过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fight this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我来想办法 你坚持住就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the plan,you just got to hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我骗你 - 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think I'm lying - Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那你知不知道 我们现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand that we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就不是真的坐在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really in this car right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在你脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在昏迷着 而且就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're in a coma and are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 因为我就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that - Because I'm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是你 一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're you,all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在你的脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我放弃试炼的真正原因仅仅是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole reason I stopped doing the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was not to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等咱们下次碰见Naomi\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next time we see Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron或者其他那些个幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Metatron or whomever's to blame for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会讨个公道的 但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get some justice,but for right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们得帮你挺过这一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to fight this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,what's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我显然是 快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I'm kinda dying here,apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,意思就是我会想出办法的 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means I'm working on it,all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我快死了 我信你 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm dying and,I believe you,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你作为你自己 事实上确实我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're you,but you're really me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我有着求生欲望的那一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the part of me that wants to fight to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道你在讲什么 但是请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you just said but continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么帮我解决困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I'm supposed to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是就说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that might supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,本来这件事儿就没希望了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fighting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,废话 当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yes,he's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的全都在点儿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the kid's got a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,会痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才在\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,马路中间干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the middle of the road like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我能听见天使的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要不我给你拿点儿水来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we get you some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't drink water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在海拔这么高的地方脱水很折磨人的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dehydration is a real bitch up here,mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你有手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,海拔太高了 没有信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signal up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要不载你一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一般都是用飞的 但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would fly but I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没有翅膀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam说他想去死 你还觉得他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam wants to die and you think he's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不想死 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想问 万一我本来就应该死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked if maybe I was supposed to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你 快消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}You,go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在你开始说我坏话之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before you throw me under the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不用感谢我去地狱救人那档子事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcomed for the Hell rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,first of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,人不是你救的 白痴 是Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't rescue jack,half-wit.Sam did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,其次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:09:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 你还在昏迷中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,you're in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,像现在这种破情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,suck as that may.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定放手就是最好的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes that's just the way things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么鬼 总会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about!There's always a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你教我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说像你俩中的某人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like the way one of you idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,冲动莽撞的自以为能骗过死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does some bass-ackwards crazy thing to beat death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,比如 出卖自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like sold your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 出卖我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly like selling my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,说的就跟你那么做有什么好结果一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,like that worked so well the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 你们俩 我都无法集中精力思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!Both of you!I can't hear myself think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你不会觉得他是对的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you're not actually buying this,are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 请问你死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me,are you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是不喘气的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定我在这儿是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe I'm here because I'm the part of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是Sam现在最需要的那一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That actually knows what the hell he's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是坐在前排的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the front seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.91,0:10:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam让我坐在这儿因为他想活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Sam put me here because he wants to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不怎么舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just got really uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,回见 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 你要是敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啧啧啧 我是对的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yip,yip,yip.Am I right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 Bobby 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly Bobby I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么是正确的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,先走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不能拿你的钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I can't take your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,买个手机 或者三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the phone,and a sandwich if they have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我不需要吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay I don't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,总会有用得上的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll figure something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,保重 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,请挂断电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我有紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on,hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以 打我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you do,hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我先打完这个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna finish this call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再来收拾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm gonna stab you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我认识你 - 我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在天堂里见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've met in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫Hael\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name was Hael.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没了翅膀还能叫天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's an angel without its wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我就直接问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna break the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有的时候人们希望我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes they wish I were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫Kim Schortz\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Kim Schortz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.94,0:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是医院里的默哀辅导员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a grief counselor in this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有点儿累\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没有冒犯的意思 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会默哀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not grieving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,至少现在还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet at least so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕不论面对现实有多困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid as hard as this may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might be a good time to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,面对不可抗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是个好人 而且你是出于好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're the nice person and that you mean well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不可抗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界里充满了反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fighting world where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,总有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而我是一个虔诚的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm a prayerful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,跟其他人一样相信奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who believes in miracles as much as the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我会看脑电图\N{\fnArial\fs30}But else I know how to read an EEG.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你还想告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unless you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在等着天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a direct line to those angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来帮你吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That you're looking for - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我想没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I...guess I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我有更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet I might have something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:14:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我后备箱里装着的可是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the King of Hell in my trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is...is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 这是什么比喻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,is that a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 你这个混蛋 听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,listen up,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,敲一下肯定 两下否定\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for yes,two for no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 别耍脾气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,don't be a pouter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是你祈祷了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You prayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你还是先帮助我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,you'll be helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你对我撒谎的话 Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you lie to me,Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会撕开你的喉咙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will rip your throat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个从家里被驱逐出来的天使都想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try every angel that was ejected from their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这样的话 我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,in that case,I have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there,brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这位年轻人祈祷的是我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}This young man has prayed for our assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们是施以严酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we creatures of wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还是施以怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我赞成后者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would argue the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me,brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我没认出你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你放下武器之后 我很乐意和你重新认识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to make you re-acquaintance,after you disarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come now,is that any way to treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在坠落中受伤的兄弟的方式吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brother injured in a fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,别在乎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到你的祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来帮助你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:15:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,本来是很平常的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a normal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,突然一切都\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,开始坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的荣光 都消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace...it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我还能听见天使电台的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do still hear angel radio,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你听到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you've heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们的兄弟姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,都还在四处飘荡寻找皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many still circling for vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中的很多都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那么无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}So afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么好怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在天堂 那里有秩序 那里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Heaven,there's order,there's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,人间有些东西比这些更有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be something even better down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这里为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's opportunity for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,和其它坠落的天使提供了机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others who have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,终于能做你喜欢的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finally do what you like to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,而不只是做你被安排的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just what you've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我喜欢做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what would I like to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你来告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能随心所欲 你想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could do anything,what would it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,上次来人间的时候我建成了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built it when I was last here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,很多年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一个很大的峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A grand canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.03,0:17:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大峡谷吗 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Grand Canyon,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们去看大峡谷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see the Grand Canyon,then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你想帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,先说你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你不和其他天使一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you're not hunting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在追杀我或者Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Castiel like the other angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我确定是有很多天使在追杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I'm sure there are many angels who are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而且数量很可能会越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many more on their way here,most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你那样公开的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put out an open prayer like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我那时实在很绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must really be desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们中的某些人仍然坚信我们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us still believe in our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着我们相信Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we believe in Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你坠落的时候受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were hurt during the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才和我兄弟扭打恶化了我的伤情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entangling with my brother back there did me no favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我剩下的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what strength I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.31,0:18:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,会全部用来帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想战斗 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to fight,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我总感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉你没办法使劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you got nothing to swing it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉你像在和影子打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're punching at shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你要放弃战斗 挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let go of fighting,scratching,and.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.65,0:19:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃求生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for loopholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你没有出路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause that ain't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 我就这么死掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what,I just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫 就这么死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了这么多好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the good you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,救了这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the people you've saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,牺牲了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the sacrifices you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你拯救了世界 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved the world,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少人能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people can say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少人能说自己的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people can say that they have left this gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the god for saken hunk of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,让这个世界更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That much a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you call dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这称为功成名就 尘归尘 土归土\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call,leaving a legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能治愈人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still able to cure things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,坠落之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我本应该可以 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,I should be,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他太虚弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron 他耍了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron,tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是天使试炼 是在驱逐天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't angel trials.It was an spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 但是我们现在有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.That's great,but we've got ourselves a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 他 他快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,he's,let's say he's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 一开始他很好 后来又不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.At first he was OK,and then he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你听见我的祈祷了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard my prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你祈祷了一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been praying to you all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean Metatron 他拿走了我的荣光 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean,Metatron he,he took my grace - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心我了 你怎么救Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me.What are you doing for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,竭尽我所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,其实还有个天使在帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's actually another angel working on it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫Ezekiel 他很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Ezekiel.He's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我觉得他很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他是个优秀的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,he's a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我到之前他应该能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should be able to help until I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no,that's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,得等几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多天使在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are angels out there,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在找你 而且他们很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for you and they're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不是所有天使都这样 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of them,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有一些只是在寻求指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are just looking for direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有一些只是迷失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are just lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我遇见了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've met one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.03,0:21:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我能帮助她 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can help her,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想帮忙 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wanna help,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但是帮助天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do,but helping angel's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,本来就是让你陷入麻烦的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}What got you in trouble in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么一次 照顾好你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once look out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我们弄清楚到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we figure out what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别相信任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抛弃他们所有人 - 我靠 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just abandon them all - Damn it Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听听你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hearing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是在战争中 而这是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a war on and it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.93,0:21:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,成千上万的天使在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's thousands of them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你失去了你的荣光 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd lost your grace,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是说你是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是说你会流血 你要吃饭 要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you bleed and you eat and you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the things you'd never.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所有你以前从来不用担心的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to worry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.19,0:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我想有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got more company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你先去基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get your ass to the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean - 去吧 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Go!Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:21:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我正努力保住这具皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to secure the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.45,0:22:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 如果我们动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no.If we move him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.09,0:22:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起去见你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can see your friend together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,事情有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.11,0:22:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be trouble,it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,最好还是我自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's best if I go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的 我的朋友他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My...My friend he.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到的 Hael\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this,Hael.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去帮助人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.17,0:23:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as these are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有天使能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No angles are coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你也出不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna okay with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.47,0:23:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.74,0:23:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别为除了我以外的任何人开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not open this door for anybody but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,救他最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都出去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody out,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能就这么让你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't just let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没了你我会迷失自己 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be lost without you,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我慢慢明白过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,I'm beginning to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把你留在我身边是我最小的要求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the least I could ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.78,0:24:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering...Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.05,0:24:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是你的错 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all your fault,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.19,0:24:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让天使们坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making the angels fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.74,0:24:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们开去大峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,we'll drive to the Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.23,0:24:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你多给我讲讲人类的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll tell me more about humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.15,0:24:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我会向你展示我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna show you what I'm capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会不只是朋友 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll going to become more than just friends,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会成为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你想附在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to possess me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.12,0:24:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的皮囊很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your vessel is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.04,0:24:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个坚持不了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one won't hold me much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.71,0:25:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.22,0:25:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能会喜欢上这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I could learn to like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.89,0:25:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 赶紧离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,you got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.47,0:25:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.19,0:25:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,待在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,或者不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.29,0:25:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你要上路所需要的一切都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything inside you need to help you on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.01,0:25:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.37,0:25:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我会准备好几瓶冰啤酒等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be waiting for you with a couple of cold ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.80,0:25:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.87,0:25:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,are you insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.40,0:25:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobby是你想死的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby was the part of you did wants to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.69,0:25:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道很难受 但他必须离开 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it stings,but he had to go - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.17,0:26:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.99,0:26:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.69,0:26:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么为之战斗的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不相信这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,see,I know you don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.37,0:26:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.21,0:26:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么计划 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.39,0:26:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的计划是去抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan is to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.80,0:26:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.18,0:26:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是去尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.44,0:26:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.51,0:26:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是去关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.44,0:26:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我什么都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are telling me that there is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.00,0:26:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在告诉我没有什么可抗争了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are telling me that there is nothing to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.56,0:26:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么可希望了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there is nothing to hope for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我在告诉你 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I'm telling you there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.20,0:26:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.54,0:26:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能不接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.21,0:26:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是确实有 在那个房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's in there.It's in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.31,0:26:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道房子里是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.91,0:26:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你自己都不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ain't not willing to fight for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.92,0:26:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:26:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.70,0:27:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我Castiel在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where Castiel is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.74,0:27:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你弟弟会生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your brother is gonna wish he were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.73,0:27:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事自己过去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck getting past the warding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.41,0:27:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.51,0:27:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们过去之后 我会剥了他的皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we do.I'm gonna strip off all his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.25,0:27:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让你看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are gonna watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.92,0:27:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.43,0:27:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有人告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody ever told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.87,0:27:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你打人像天使一样没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit like an angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好的,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK,wait,wait,wait,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.42,0:28:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉你Cass在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you where Cass is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.40,0:28:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.25,0:28:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果天堂被锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Heaven is locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我做这个 你们会去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you go when I do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.49,0:28:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.20,0:29:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,警报突然就响起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.29,0:29:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这些反天使标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the warding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我恐怕我比我想象中的更虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm weaker than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.36,0:29:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.39,0:29:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有过协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.85,0:29:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我掩护你救Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight,you save.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.56,0:29:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没那个能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would that I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕现在太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just afraid it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.10,0:29:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.18,0:29:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说没有办法来救我弟弟的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying there is no way to save my brother's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.82,0:29:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我恐怕没有好的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No good ways I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.14,0:29:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那坏的方法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.02,0:29:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们还有的选择 不论好坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get options here,man,good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.89,0:29:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,让我听听你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.52,0:29:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有个我能拯救你弟弟的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a chance I can fix your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.45,0:29:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,用我体内的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}From me inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}From inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.22,0:29:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.39,0:29:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把他开个大洞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna open him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.40,0:29:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你想附身Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to possess Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.09,0:29:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.72,0:29:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你要明白 是你需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood,It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.20,0:29:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是Sam需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's Sam's call.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.83,0:29:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是Sam是绝对不会同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way in hell he'd say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.43,0:29:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,自己被任何东西附身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To being possess by anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.10,0:29:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他宁愿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would rather die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.80,0:30:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不打扰你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you two alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.56,0:30:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.60,0:30:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我考虑这件事 我的意思是只是考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I consider this,I mean just consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.59,0:30:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need something,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须证明给我他现在到底有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to prove me how bad he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.65,0:30:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我得承认 在我听说是你要来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must admit it when I heard it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.63,0:30:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得有必要亲自跑一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I had to come myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.26,0:31:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜这件事情会使你得到愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you get off on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.02,0:31:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.81,0:31:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是你想象的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not in the way you assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.32,0:31:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来接手像Sam Winchester这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I consider it to be quite the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.28,0:31:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be collecting the likes of Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.64,0:31:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向尽量避免通过类似的审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried so hard not to pass judgment at times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.01,0:31:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不合我的口味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my bag,you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.85,0:31:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,干得不错 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played,my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.04,0:31:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要知道一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.23,0:31:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.68,0:31:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.87,0:31:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你能保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这次就是最后的终结了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That this time it will be final.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.26,0:31:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That if I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.96,0:31:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:31:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能转化我 没人能用交易救活我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can reverse,nobody can deal it a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会因我而受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody else get hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.86,0:32:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我能承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.81,0:32:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈在干什么 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你看到的 已经没剩多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see,there's not much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.92,0:32:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,附身之后会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.07,0:32:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大家互惠互利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutual benefit I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.60,0:32:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以在治愈Sam的同时为自己养伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heal Sam when I'm healing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.24,0:32:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那等到他复原的时候呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he's healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.62,0:32:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.40,0:33:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是目前最好的情况了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best of the bad situation,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.21,0:33:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.90,0:33:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那也不意味着你能霸占他的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't means squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.68,0:33:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam永远也不会同意的 对你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam would never say yes,not to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.97,0:33:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不会拒绝你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he would say yes to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.87,0:34:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我本不想伤害任何天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to hurt any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.31,0:34:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.40,0:34:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会奉献我的一生来帮助你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will devote my life to helping you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.32,0:34:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你的话听起来有多可笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how ridiculous you sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.66,0:34:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在你做过那样的事请之后 还想帮助天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help angels?After what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.46,0:34:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不需要你的帮助 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want your help,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.49,0:34:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了 我也是你们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong,I'm one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.04,0:34:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远都是你们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never stop being one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.92,0:34:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.16,0:34:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在一起的话 我能保护你 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together,I can protect you,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.38,0:34:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.61,0:34:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不需要你的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want your protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.81,0:34:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你就这么把我留在这个破皮囊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you leave me here in this broken girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.43,0:34:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.56,0:34:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉他们你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell them where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.71,0:34:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们会追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will hunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.71,0:34:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最后一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until their last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都会找那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will seek revenge on the angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.73,0:34:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭天堂的天使报仇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That did this who destroyed heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.07,0:34:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会找你报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll seek a vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.02,0:35:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,跟这次的情况相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}On you that will make god striking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.39,0:35:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当年上帝驱逐Lucifer看起来像小儿科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer seemed like child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.94,0:35:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以别说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.60,0:35:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉所有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go on angel radio and tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你的所作所为 除非你接受我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything unless you open your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.59,0:35:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,接受我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.51,0:35:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候了Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.94,0:35:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.59,0:35:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean - 没事 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - It's okay,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.27,0:35:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.35,0:35:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来想带月形面包圈 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would brought cronuts but.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.35,0:35:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,时间有限 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's short so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.27,0:35:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实 - 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By all means - What's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.03,0:35:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我找到办法了 - 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found a plan - It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.45,0:35:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.00,0:35:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.68,0:35:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 你确实是在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me - Are you even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.86,0:35:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再为此挣扎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fighting this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.00,0:35:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须挺过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to fight this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.08,0:35:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.12,0:35:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你不能拒绝我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,but not if you shut me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.30,0:35:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还不到时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.97,0:35:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,多少时间是由Sam决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for Sam to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 听我说 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,Sam,listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:35:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我承诺过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.57,0:36:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我 在那个教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that church.You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.04,0:36:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不论面对什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.41,0:36:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,靠 不就是说现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell if this ain't whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.07,0:36:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须让我进去 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to let me in,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.37,0:36:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你得让我来帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.64,0:36:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有你 我活着还有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no me if there ain't no you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.40,0:36:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.07,0:36:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你同意了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.96,0:36:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.31,0:36:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.02,0:36:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.01,0:36:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.58,0:36:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.02,0:37:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.30,0:37:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你进去的时候是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the looking there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.21,0:37:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.87,0:37:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,让他痊愈得花费一番功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's much work need to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.61,0:37:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他会醒过来的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he's gonna wake up,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.04,0:37:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.27,0:37:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 他会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.81,0:37:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他会感觉到你的存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,is he gonna feel you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.67,0:37:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,会默默数伤口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triaging his spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.21,0:37:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他感觉不到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not feel me,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.51,0:37:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam不需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.40,0:37:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我在他体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know I'm in here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.65,0:37:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗 不 这明明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking?No.This is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.21,0:37:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一件大事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.38,0:37:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what will he do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.67,0:37:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他被天使附身 他会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do tell him he's possessed by an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他能理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,he'll have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.55,0:37:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.61,0:37:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有他的允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without his acceptance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.63,0:37:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam随时随地都能驱逐我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can eject me,at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.87,0:37:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是在我很虚弱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially with me so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.48,0:37:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Sam不让我待下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Sam does eject me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.05,0:37:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.27,0:38:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们从现在就开始保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll keep the secret for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,或者等到Sam能够适应的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or until Sam's well enough that he.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.82,0:38:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等他不需要天使代步器的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't need angelic pacemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.60,0:38:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,或者我想办法告诉他 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll find a way to tell him.I...I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.12,0:38:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 现在就相当于他住院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,as for him,being in hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.98,0:38:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须找到解决的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.20,0:38:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你愿意 我可以清除他所有的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can erase that all if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.91,0:38:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他什么都不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not remember any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.16,0:40:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.92,0:40:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.63,0:40:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you're,how you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像睡了一周一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm slept for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,睡了一天还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.01,0:40:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你从天使坠天开始一直睡到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But out since the sky was spittin' angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.78,0:40:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.24,0:40:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.47,0:40:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,教堂在摇晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The church is feeling like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.23,0:40:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,天使在坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.39,0:40:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.42,0:40:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你没有难受的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're feeling good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.82,0:40:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我 我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I mean I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在副驾驶上晕了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been driving around with me passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.64,0:40:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你也就开了一天的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the passenger seat for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.03,0:41:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也停过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I stopped,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.87,0:41:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一群日本游客照照相什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let a few Japanese tourists take some pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.51,0:41:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没人吃我豆腐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody gets too handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.23,0:41:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'd pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.46,0:41:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在教堂里说的那些话 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant what I said at church.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.15,0:41:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,以你的能力 干什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're capable of anything,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.50,0:41:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是错了 也没机会跟你说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell,if you didn't prove me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.47,0:41:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.29,0:41:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有活要干\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we got work to do
